{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "month": "2026-12",
  "version": "e78e0f98658d",
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "2026-12-01",
      "date": "2026-12-01",
      "text": "但是他的容忍是与一种对自己的不满混合在一起的，因为如果我们坦率一些，我们都会承认，我们不如意的时候所感到的痛苦，大多来自这种对自己的不满，不论妻子或丈夫莫不如此。如果我们强大一些，环境对我们的作用就弱一些，这始终是真理。",
      "author": "乔治·艾略特",
      "source": "米德尔马契",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "book",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/Mu6FGw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-05-ef4a815dabf1.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-02",
      "date": "2026-12-02",
      "text": "我们要一直往上爬，总有一天抵达月亮吧。",
      "author": "千都",
      "source": "少女终末旅行",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/aEzPaA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-38-e7a4cd9d235c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-03",
      "date": "2026-12-03",
      "text": "医生说他太老了，身体的各个器官都衰竭了，只有心脏还不肯放弃。我想那是因为我吧，爸妈不回来，他怎么放心把我一个人孤零零地留在这儿呢？",
      "author": "蒋雯丽",
      "source": "我们天上见",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/QUAm6g.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-32-45fcbca5f7e5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-04",
      "date": "2026-12-04",
      "text": "云无心以出岫，鸟倦飞而知还。",
      "author": "陶渊明",
      "source": "归去来兮辞",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "window",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/YP5pBA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/mountain-path-8f42fd7e84d1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-05",
      "date": "2026-12-05",
      "text": "世界是你们的，也是我们的，但是归根结底是你们的。你们青年人朝气蓬勃，正在兴旺时期，好像早晨八九点钟的太阳。希望寄托在你们身上。",
      "author": "毛泽东",
      "source": "毛泽东",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/3knuuA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-10-4118047c78cc.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-06",
      "date": "2026-12-06",
      "text": "无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "source": "登高",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "moon",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/CPlaMA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-22-5ea1c70e5f6d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-07",
      "date": "2026-12-07",
      "text": "博美说人生极其有限，她虽没有我对日月由曲折变为简单，由深刻变为浅白的理解。但有一点她是知道的，抓住一切机会，享受短暂人生，为生命的每一刻制造出人生的最高价值。",
      "author": "叶广芩",
      "source": "状元媒",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/LJea9A.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-39-b218cd4d5171.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-08",
      "date": "2026-12-08",
      "text": "隐藏的是心中的秘密，照耀两人的是star和snow……",
      "author": "青山刚昌",
      "source": "名侦探柯南",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/wqKGsQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-25-a1dffbe755cd.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-09",
      "date": "2026-12-09",
      "text": "有人住高楼，有人在深沟；有人光万丈，有人一身锈；世人万千种，浮云莫去求；斯人若彩虹，遇上方知有。",
      "author": "文德琳・范・德拉安南",
      "source": "怦然心动",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "ticket",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/15BUTw.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-14-1e15f145f007.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-10",
      "date": "2026-12-10",
      "text": "爸爸我也不是一生下来就是爸爸，爸爸也是头一次当爸爸。",
      "author": "德善父亲",
      "source": "请回答1988",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/18Kl4w.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-34-8e2ad1d00d7e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-11",
      "date": "2026-12-11",
      "text": "我在工作笔记本的扉页摘抄下《始于极限》里的一段话：“在达到极限之前能做什么，明确区分自己做得到的和做不到的，放弃做不到的，真诚、仔细、踏实地做那些做得到的......只有这样，才能产生自信和信任。”",
      "author": "张小满",
      "source": "大厂小民",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "book",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/xacMbg.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-20-0992c57e80e1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-12",
      "date": "2026-12-12",
      "text": "逆风，可以让我飞得更高。",
      "author": "火箭小子",
      "source": "和平精英",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/1x2AFw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-31-4841a7de2770.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-13",
      "date": "2026-12-13",
      "text": "诗之为道，既以描写人生为事，而人生者，非孤立之生活，而在家族、国家及社会中之生活也。",
      "author": "王国维",
      "source": "屈子文学之精神",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "paper",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/k7kxtA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-07-968a33c8a8bb.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-14",
      "date": "2026-12-14",
      "text": "蝉噪林逾静，鸟鸣山更幽。",
      "author": "王籍",
      "source": "入若耶溪",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "vertical",
      "font": "mashanzheng",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/b4Cl7A.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-37-b5b58258072a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-15",
      "date": "2026-12-15",
      "text": "明白一个事理时，也不巴望告之于人。我不介意别人赞成不赞成。我当然认为自己对，不然，又何至于那样去想；我也当然觉得他们错了，不过，错归错，我并不以为忤。发现自己和大多数人意见相左，并不太会让我惴惴难安。我对自己的直觉尚有几分信心。",
      "author": "毛姆",
      "source": "我的心渴望一种更加惊险的生活",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "type",
      "font": "xiaowei",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/XpE0IA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-1793799217632-19fcfd1f0f6f.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-16",
      "date": "2026-12-16",
      "text": "我可是要成为海贼王的男人！",
      "author": "路飞",
      "source": "海贼王",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "sea",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/8A7a5A.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-19-7f27be710b03.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-17",
      "date": "2026-12-17",
      "text": "这，这…啊！这是家杰的眼晴！喜悦和忧虑，烦恼和欢欣，痛苦和希望，全在这双眼晴中闪现。不用眼底灯，不用裂隙镜，就可以看到他的眼底，看到他的心底。",
      "author": "谌容",
      "source": "人到中年",
      "category": "小说",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "letter",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/tRTGdw.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-12-55786b92929b.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-18",
      "date": "2026-12-18",
      "text": "星露谷永远都会迎来下一个春天，你也一样。",
      "author": "ConcernedApe",
      "source": "星露谷物语",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "collage",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/kwlpkA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-02-8eeef28d2a41.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-19",
      "date": "2026-12-19",
      "text": "一个人采取何种态度，这或许才是生活中最重要的事情，但这与对事实的学习无关。",
      "author": "索姆斯",
      "source": "20世纪分析哲学史1",
      "category": "语录",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "excerpt",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/Sax5ZA.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-01-6ec68b9d0eff.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-20",
      "date": "2026-12-20",
      "text": "隔着人潮呼救像只困兽，呼吸颤抖去泪流，去相拥。",
      "author": "南语",
      "source": "不痛",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "photo",
      "font": "longcang",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/vOaVeQ.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-24-bfdf6de59e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-21",
      "date": "2026-12-21",
      "text": "深林人不知，\n明月来相照。",
      "author": "王维",
      "source": "竹里馆",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "window",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/XJ6PaQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-33-073e2082bcc6.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-22",
      "date": "2026-12-22",
      "text": "世界怎样与我无关，以我自己的意识！",
      "author": "格拉汉姆艾卡",
      "source": "机动战士高达00",
      "category": "动漫",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "poster",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/aXaoUQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-09-3dc122da8f7c.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-23",
      "date": "2026-12-23",
      "text": "大鹏一日同风起，扶摇直上九万里。",
      "author": "李白",
      "source": "上李邕",
      "category": "散文",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "horizon",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/t2GRLA.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-35-b2e23608f1fd.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-24",
      "date": "2026-12-24",
      "text": "我喜欢大海和蓝天，因为它们和外婆是同样的颜色。",
      "author": "水母莱莱",
      "source": "蛋仔派对",
      "category": "游戏",
      "background": "sea",
      "template": "light",
      "font": "wenkai",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/10wsHQ.png",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-16-6089887b4188.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-25",
      "date": "2026-12-25",
      "text": "阶砖不会拒绝磨蚀，窗花不可幽禁落霞。",
      "author": "黄伟文",
      "source": "喜帖街",
      "category": "台词",
      "background": "mist",
      "template": "split",
      "font": "notosans",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/mAiJog.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/spring-hills-b45fb1070f09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-12-26",
      "date": "2026-12-26",
      "text": "渺万里层云，千山暮雪，只影向谁去？",
      "author": "元好问",
      "source": "摸鱼儿·雁丘词 / 迈陂塘",
      "category": "诗词",
      "background": "dusk",
      "template": "moon",
      "font": "notoserif",
      "revision": 3,
      "image": "https://p.ipic.vip/PJrgbg.jpg",
      "imageMirror": "https://gh-proxy.com/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/summerandwinter/wstore/main/imagery/gen-gap-11-99cc5057ba1c.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
